    "body": "> I went over this list with [@nt1m](https://github.com/nt1m) today: [#12104 (comment)](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12104#issuecomment-3837481899) \n\nWe had a breakout session on these, and got through the first 7. The remainder are:\n\n * [[css-forms-1] Have 2 slider-fill pseudos? (upper vs lower slider fills) w3c/csswg-drafts#12419](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12419)\n * [[css-forms-1] Define range slider datalist integration w3c/csswg-drafts#12963](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12963)\n * [[css-forms-1] Checkbox/radio button base appearance has no disabled state w3c/csswg-drafts#12225](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12225)\n * [[css-forms-1] Checkbox stylesheet missing indeterminate handling w3c/csswg-drafts#11869](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11869)\n * [[css-forms-1] Specify readonly input styles w3c/csswg-drafts#12490](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12490)",
